#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:5
msgid "Delete part"
msgstr "删除部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech element editor allows deleting `parts`_ which has been `added`_"
" or `pasted`_ at the `element editor workspace`_ previously."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 元件编辑器允许删除此前已 `添加 <added_>`_ 或 `粘贴 <pasted_>`_ 到 `元件编辑器工作区 "
"<element editor workspace_>`_ 的 `部件 <parts_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:10
msgid ""
"Deleting parts can be done from `menu bar`_, `toolbar`_, by right click on "
"the `part`_ and using the corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"可以通过 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_、`工具栏 <toolbar_>`_、右键点击 `部件 <part_>`_ 或相应的快捷键来删除部件。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:14
msgid "Delete part from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏删除部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:16
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:27
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:52
msgid "`Select`_ the `part`_ which should be deleted."
msgstr "`选择 <Select_>`_ 要删除的 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:17
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Delete** menu item to delete the `part`_ from `workspace`_."
msgstr "选择 **编辑 > 删除** 菜单项，从 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中删除 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:22
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element editor Edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元件编辑器“编辑”菜单"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:25
msgid "Delete part from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏删除部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:28
msgid ""
"Select the icon |edit-delete| from the `toolbar`_ to delete the `part`_ from"
" `workspace`_."
msgstr ""
"在 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 中选择 |edit-delete| 图标，从 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中删除 `部件 "
"<part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:30
msgid "edit-delete"
msgstr "edit-delete"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:34
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Tools**"
msgstr "如果未显示 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ ，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 工具** 中将其显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:37
msgid "Delete part by right click"
msgstr "通过右键删除部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:39
msgid "Right click on the `part`_ which should be deleted."
msgstr "右键点击要删除的 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:40
msgid "Select the option **Delete** to delete the `part`_ from `workspace`_."
msgstr "选择 **删除** 选项，从 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中删除 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:45
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech right click PopUp window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 右键弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:48
msgid "Delete part using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用快捷键删除部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:50
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:53
msgid "Press ``Del`` to delete the `part`_ from `workspace`_."
msgstr "按 ``Del`` 从 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中删除 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/delete.rst:57
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "有关 QElectroTech 键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参阅 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
